       0780-CABIN-DINING-HIST.  
           IF RSP06-PAX-DINING-PREF OF RSP06-OLD (1) =  
                 RSP06-PAX-DINING-PREF OF RSP06-NEW (1) AND 
                 RSP06-PAX-DINING-CNF OF RSP06-OLD (1) =
                 RSP06-PAX-DINING-CNF OF RSP06-NEW (1)  
              GO TO 0800-CHECK-RESIDENT-OVERRIDE.   

           MOVE SPACES     TO WS-HISTORY-AN-PARAMS. 
           MOVE LOW-VALUES TO WS-HISTORY-N-PARAMS.  
           MOVE 'CDC'      TO WS-HIST-ACTIVITY-TYPE.

           STRING 'DINE-CNF: ' RSP06-PAX-DINING-CNF OF RSP06-OLD (1)
                  '  DINE-WL: ' RSP06-PAX-DINING-PREF OF RSP06-OLD (1)  
                 DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-HIST-COMMENT.

           MOVE WS-HIST-COMMENT TO WS-HIST-TRF-COMMENT2.
           MOVE 'Y'             TO WS-HIST-TRF-IND. 

           PERFORM 8000-WRITE-HISTORY THRU 8099-EXIT.   

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       0800-CHECK-RESIDENT-OVERRIDE.
           IF (RSP29-IBR-OVR-RESIDENT-ST-FLAG = ZERO)   
              GO TO 0820-CHECK-OCCUPANCY-OVERRIDE.  

           MOVE SPACES     TO WS-HISTORY-AN-PARAMS. 
           MOVE LOW-VALUES TO WS-HISTORY-N-PARAMS.  
           MOVE 'RSO'      TO WS-HIST-ACTIVITY-TYPE.
           MOVE 'Y'        TO WS-HIST-TRF-OVERRIDE-IND  

           STRING 'RESIDENT STATE OVERRIDE' 
                 DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-HIST-COMMENT.

           MOVE WS-HIST-COMMENT TO WS-HIST-TRF-COMMENT1.
           MOVE 'Y'             TO WS-HIST-TRF-IND. 

           PERFORM 8000-WRITE-HISTORY THRU 8099-EXIT.   

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       0820-CHECK-OCCUPANCY-OVERRIDE.   
           IF RSP29-IBR-FLAG-OVR-OR-CODE <= SPACES  
156569        GO TO 0830-CHECK-PAY-NOTIF-IND.   

           MOVE SPACES     TO WS-HISTORY-AN-PARAMS. 
           MOVE LOW-VALUES TO WS-HISTORY-N-PARAMS.  
           MOVE 'COO'      TO WS-HIST-ACTIVITY-TYPE.
           MOVE 'Y'        TO WS-HIST-TRF-IND.  

           IF (RSP06-IBR-CABIN-NUM OF RSP06-NEW (1:1) = 'C' OR 'T') 
              MOVE 'N'            TO WS-HIST-TRF-OVERRIDE-IND   
           ELSE 
              MOVE 'Y'        TO WS-HIST-TRF-OVERRIDE-IND.  

           EVALUATE RSP29-IBR-FLAG-OVR-OR-CODE  
              WHEN 'M'  
                 MOVE 'MAXIMUM OCCUPANCY OVERRIDE' TO WS-HIST-COMMENT   
              WHEN 'N'  
                 MOVE 'NORMAL OCCUPANCY OVERRIDE' TO WS-HIST-COMMENT
              WHEN 'p'  
                 MOVE 'MINIMUM GUEST OVERRIDE' TO WS-HIST-COMMENT   
              WHEN OTHER
                 STRING 'SPOIL ' RSP29-IBR-FLAG-OVR-OR-CODE ' ' 
                        'OCCUPANCY OVERRIDE'
                        DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-HIST-COMMENT  
           END-EVALUATE.

           MOVE WS-HIST-COMMENT TO WS-HIST-TRF-COMMENT1.

           PERFORM 8000-WRITE-HISTORY THRU 8099-EXIT.   

