       0840-CHECK-PIAR-HIST.
           IF (RSP06-I-PIAR-READ-IND OF RSP06-NEW = 'N') AND
                 (RSP06-I-PIAR-READ-IND OF RSP06-OLD  = 'N')
              GO TO 0860-CHECK-PIER-HIST.   

           IF (RSP06-I-PIAR-EXIST-IND OF RSP06-NEW = 'N') AND   
                 (RSP06-I-PIAR-EXIST-IND OF RSP06-OLD  = 'N')   
              GO TO 0860-CHECK-PIER-HIST.   

           IF (RSP06-I-PIAR-INFO OF RSP06-NEW = 
                 RSP06-I-PIAR-INFO OF RSP06-OLD)
              GO TO 0860-CHECK-PIER-HIST.   

           MOVE SPACES     TO WS-HISTORY-AN-PARAMS. 
           MOVE LOW-VALUES TO WS-HISTORY-N-PARAMS.  
           MOVE 'APU'      TO WS-HIST-ACTIVITY-TYPE.
           MOVE 'CABIN LEVEL HOME ADDRESS CHANGE' TO WS-HIST-COMMENT.   

