       1040-CHECK-CXP-PTFRS.
           IF (RSP06-PTFR-READ-IND OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB) NOT = 'Y')   
              MOVE 7 TO DPP42-HOLD-MSG-INDEX
              GO TO 9200-EDIT-ERROR-MSG.

           IF (RSP06-PTFR-EXIST-IND OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB) NOT = 'Y')  
              GO TO 1080-CANCEL-PAX-HISTORY.

           MOVE ZERO TO PTFR-SUB.   

       1060-NEXT-CXP-PTFR.  
           ADD 1 TO PTFR-SUB.   

           IF PTFR-SUB > RSP06-PTFR-TRANSFER-CNT OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB)
              GO TO 1080-CANCEL-PAX-HISTORY.

146816     IF  RSP06-PTFR-CANCEL-DATE OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB PTFR-SUB)  
146816         > ZEROES 
146816         GO TO 1060-NEXT-CXP-PTFR 
146816     END-IF.  

           MOVE SPACES     TO WS-HISTORY-AN-PARAMS. 
           MOVE LOW-VALUES TO WS-HISTORY-N-PARAMS.  
           MOVE OSUB       TO WS-HIST-PAX-NUM.  
           MOVE RSP06-PAX-SEQ-NUM OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB) TO
                WS-HIST-PAX-SEQ-NUM.
           MOVE RSP06-PAX-CITY-CODE OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB) TO  
                WS-HIST-CITY-CODE.  
