PPC470          WS-HIST-FARE-TYPE.  
           MOVE 'CTX'         TO WS-HIST-ACTIVITY-TYPE. 
           MOVE 'CANCEL PAX'  TO WS-HIST-CONTACT.   

           IF RSP06-PTFR-PURCHASE-SRC OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB PTFR-SUB)  
                 NOT = 'S'  
              COMPUTE WS-HIST-AMT = 
                      RSP06-PTFR-AMT OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB PTFR-SUB) * -1. 

           IF RSP06-PTFR-PRE-POST-IND OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB PTFR-SUB) = 'I'
              IF RSP06-PTFR-LOC-CODE OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB PTFR-SUB) > ' ' 
                 STRING 'DELETED XFER ' DELIMITED BY SIZE   
                        RSP06-PTFR-LOC-CODE OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB PTFR-SUB)
                        ' TO PIER ' 
                        DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-HIST-COMMENT  
              ELSE  
                 MOVE 'DELETED XFER FFF TO PIER ' TO WS-HIST-COMMENT
           ELSE 
              IF RSP06-PTFR-LOC-CODE OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB PTFR-SUB) > ' ' 
                 STRING 'DELETED XFER PIER TO ' 
                        RSP06-PTFR-LOC-CODE OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB PTFR-SUB)
                        DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-HIST-COMMENT  
              ELSE  
                 MOVE 'DELETED XFER PIER TO FFF' TO WS-HIST-COMMENT.

           MOVE WS-HIST-COMMENT TO WS-HIST-TRF-COMMENT1.
           MOVE 'Y'             TO WS-HIST-TRF-IND. 

           IF RSP06-PAX-CNT OF RSP06-NEW > 1
               COMPUTE WS-HIST-TRF-OLD-AMT =
                   RSP06-PDI-PAX-GROSS-FARE-AMT OF RSP06-OLD
                   (RSP06-PAX-CNT OF RSP06-NEW) * -1
           ELSE 
               COMPUTE WS-HIST-TRF-OLD-AMT =
                   RSP06-IB-PAX-GROSS-FARE-AMT OF RSP06-NEW 
                 - RSP06-IB-PAX-GROSS-FARE-AMT OF RSP06-OLD.

           PERFORM 8000-WRITE-HISTORY THRU 8099-EXIT.   

           GO TO 1060-NEXT-CXP-PTFR.

      *=================================================================

       1080-CANCEL-PAX-HISTORY. 
           MOVE SPACES     TO WS-HISTORY-AN-PARAMS. 
           MOVE LOW-VALUES TO WS-HISTORY-N-PARAMS.  
           MOVE 'CXP'      TO WS-HIST-ACTIVITY-TYPE.
           MOVE OSUB       TO WS-HIST-PAX-NUM.  
           MOVE RSP06-PAX-SEQ-NUM OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB) TO
                WS-HIST-PAX-SEQ-NUM.
           MOVE RSP06-PAX-CITY-CODE OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB) TO  
                WS-HIST-CITY-CODE.  
