PPC470          WS-HIST-FARE-TYPE.  
           MOVE 'Y'        TO WS-HIST-TRF-OVERRIDE-IND. 

           PERFORM VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1  
                   UNTIL SUB > RSP06-PAX-CNT OF RSP06-NEW   
              IF RSP06-PAX-ORIGINAL-GUEST-IND OF RSP06-NEW (SUB) = 'Y'  
                 MOVE 'N' TO WS-HIST-TRF-OVERRIDE-IND   
                 MOVE RSP06-PAX-CNT OF RSP06-NEW TO SUB 
              END-IF
           END-PERFORM. 

           STRING RSP06-PAX-LAST-NAME OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB) ','   
                  RSP06-PAX-TITLE OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB) ','   
                  RSP06-PAX-FIRST-NAME OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB)  
                  DELIMITED BY SPACES INTO WS-HIST-COMMENT. 

           MOVE WS-HIST-COMMENT TO WS-HIST-TRF-COMMENT1.
           MOVE 'Y'             TO WS-HIST-TRF-IND. 

           COMPUTE WS-HIST-TRF-AMT = -1 *   
                   (RSP06-PDI-PAX-GROSS-FARE-AMT OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB)
                    - RSP06-TIR-PREMIUM-AMT OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB)).   

           PERFORM 8000-WRITE-HISTORY THRU 8099-EXIT.   

            IF  RSP29-I-CANCEL-REASON-TEXT > SPACES 
214595          MOVE SPACES                     TO WS-HIST-COMMENT  
214595                                             WS-HIST-TRF-COMMENT1 
                MOVE RSP29-I-CANCEL-REASON-TEXT TO WS-HIST-COMMENT  
                                                   WS-HIST-TRF-COMMENT1 
214595          MOVE 'Y'                        TO WS-HIST-TRF-IND  
                PERFORM 8000-WRITE-HISTORY THRU 8099-EXIT   
            END-IF. 
