       2800-CHECK-DAMAGE-DEP.   
           IF (RSP06-PAX-DAMAGE-DEPOSIT-IND OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) =   
                 RSP06-PAX-DAMAGE-DEPOSIT-IND OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB) AND   
                 RSP06-PAX-DAMAGE-DEPOSIT-AMT OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) = 
                 RSP06-PAX-DAMAGE-DEPOSIT-AMT OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB)) OR   
                 (RSP29-REPRICE-FLAG = 1)   
              GO TO 2820-CHECK-PAX-CMT-CODES.   

           IF RSP06-PAX-DAMAGE-DEPOSIT-IND OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB) <= SPACES
              IF RSP06-PAX-DAMAGE-DEPOSIT-IND OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) = 'N' 
                 GO TO 2820-CHECK-PAX-CMT-CODES.

           MOVE SPACES     TO WS-HISTORY-AN-PARAMS. 
           MOVE LOW-VALUES TO WS-HISTORY-N-PARAMS.  
           MOVE 'CDD'      TO WS-HIST-ACTIVITY-TYPE.
           MOVE NSUB       TO WS-HIST-PAX-NUM.  
           MOVE RSP06-PAX-SEQ-NUM OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO
                WS-HIST-PAX-SEQ-NUM.
           MOVE RSP06-PAX-CITY-CODE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO  
                WS-HIST-CITY-CODE.  
PPC470*    MOVE RSP06-PAX-FARE-CODE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO  
PPC470*         WS-HIST-FARE-CODE.  
PPC470     MOVE RSP06-PAX-OFFER-CODE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO 
PPC470          WS-HIST-OFFER-CODE. 
PPC470     MOVE RSP06-PAX-FARE-TYPE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO  
PPC470          WS-HIST-FARE-TYPE.  

           COMPUTE WS-HIST-AMT =
                      RSP06-PAX-DAMAGE-DEPOSIT-AMT OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB)  
                    - RSP06-PAX-DAMAGE-DEPOSIT-AMT OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB). 

           STRING 'DAMAGE-DEPOSIT: '
                  RSP06-PAX-DAMAGE-DEPOSIT-IND OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB)  
                  DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-HIST-COMMENT.   

           MOVE WS-HIST-COMMENT TO WS-HIST-TRF-COMMENT2.
           MOVE 'Y'             TO WS-HIST-TRF-IND. 


           PERFORM 8000-WRITE-HISTORY THRU 8099-EXIT.   

