       2820-CHECK-PAX-CMT-CODES.
           IF (RSP06-PAX-COMMENT-TABLE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) =
                 RSP06-PAX-COMMENT-TABLE OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB))   
              GO TO 2840-CHECK-PAX-STATE.   

           MOVE SPACES     TO WS-HISTORY-AN-PARAMS. 
           MOVE LOW-VALUES TO WS-HISTORY-N-PARAMS.  
           MOVE 'CGC'      TO WS-HIST-ACTIVITY-TYPE.
           MOVE NSUB       TO WS-HIST-PAX-NUM   
           MOVE RSP06-PAX-SEQ-NUM OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO
                WS-HIST-PAX-SEQ-NUM.
           MOVE RSP06-PAX-CITY-CODE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO  
                WS-HIST-CITY-CODE.  
PPC470*    MOVE RSP06-PAX-FARE-CODE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO  
PPC470*         WS-HIST-FARE-CODE.  
PPC470     MOVE RSP06-PAX-OFFER-CODE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO 
PPC470          WS-HIST-OFFER-CODE. 
PPC470     MOVE RSP06-PAX-FARE-TYPE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO  
PPC470          WS-HIST-FARE-TYPE.  

           IF RSP06-PAX-COMMENT-TABLE OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB) > SPACES  
              IF RSP06-PAX-COMMENT-TABLE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) > SPACES   
                 STRING 'PAX CODE ' DELIMITED BY SIZE   
                        RSP06-PAX-COMMENT-TABLE OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB) 
                        DELIMITED BY ' '
                        ' TO ' DELIMITED BY SIZE
                        RSP06-PAX-COMMENT-TABLE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) 
                        DELIMITED BY ' ' INTO WS-HIST-COMMENT   
              ELSE  
                 STRING 'PAX CODE ' DELIMITED BY SIZE   
                        RSP06-PAX-COMMENT-TABLE OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB) 
                        DELIMITED BY ' ' ' REMOVED '
                        DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-HIST-COMMENT  
           ELSE 
              STRING 'PAX CODE ' DELIMITED BY SIZE  
                     RSP06-PAX-COMMENT-TABLE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB)
                     DELIMITED BY ' ' ' ADDED ' 
                     DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-HIST-COMMENT.

           MOVE WS-HIST-COMMENT TO WS-HIST-TRF-COMMENT2.
           MOVE 'Y'             TO WS-HIST-TRF-IND. 

           PERFORM 8000-WRITE-HISTORY THRU 8099-EXIT.   

           PERFORM 8550-COMPARE-MEDICAL-CODES THRU 8599-EXIT.   

