       2900-CHECK-NON-REFUND.   
           MOVE RSP06-PAX-NON-REFUND-AMT OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB) TO 
                WS-DOLLAR-VALUE.

124575     IF (WS-DOLLAR-VALUE IS NOT NUMERIC) OR   
124575           WS-DOLLAR-VALUE = ZERO 
124575        MOVE ZERO TO RSP06-PAX-NON-REFUND-AMT OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB).

           IF (RSP06-PAX-NON-REFUND-AMT OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) =   
                 RSP06-PAX-NON-REFUND-AMT OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB))  
              GO TO 2920-CHECK-AOR. 

           MOVE SPACES     TO WS-HISTORY-AN-PARAMS. 
           MOVE LOW-VALUES TO WS-HISTORY-N-PARAMS.  
           MOVE NSUB       TO WS-HIST-PAX-NUM.  
           MOVE 'NRF'      TO WS-HIST-ACTIVITY-TYPE.
           MOVE RSP06-PAX-SEQ-NUM OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO
                WS-HIST-PAX-SEQ-NUM.
           MOVE RSP06-PAX-CITY-CODE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO  
                WS-HIST-CITY-CODE.  
PPC470*    MOVE RSP06-PAX-FARE-CODE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO  
PPC470*         WS-HIST-FARE-CODE.  
PPC470     MOVE RSP06-PAX-OFFER-CODE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO 
PPC470          WS-HIST-OFFER-CODE. 
PPC470     MOVE RSP06-PAX-FARE-TYPE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO  
PPC470          WS-HIST-FARE-TYPE.  

           MOVE RSP06-PAX-NON-REFUND-AMT OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB) TO 
                WS-DSPAMT8-1.   
           MOVE RSP06-PAX-NON-REFUND-AMT OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO 
                WS-DSPAMT8-2.   

           STRING 'NRF Amt from ' WS-DSPAMT8-1 ' to ' WS-DSPAMT8-2  
                  DELIMITED BY SIZE   INTO WS-HIST-COMMENT. 

126688     MOVE WS-HIST-COMMENT TO WS-HIST-TRF-COMMENT2.
126688     MOVE 'Y'             TO WS-HIST-TRF-IND. 

           PERFORM 8000-WRITE-HISTORY THRU 8099-EXIT.   

