       2920-CHECK-AOR.  
           IF (RSP06-PAX-AIR-IND OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) =  
                 RSP06-PAX-AIR-IND OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB)) AND 
                 (RSP06-PAX-CITY-CODE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) = 
                 RSP06-PAX-CITY-CODE OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB))   
              GO TO 2940-CHECK-INS-HISTORY. 

126688*    IF NOT (RSP06-PAX-AIR-IND OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) = 'B' AND 'Q') 
126688*       GO TO 2940-CHECK-INS-HISTORY. 

           MOVE SPACES     TO WS-HISTORY-AN-PARAMS. 
           MOVE LOW-VALUES TO WS-HISTORY-N-PARAMS.  
           MOVE NSUB       TO WS-HIST-PAX-NUM.  
           MOVE 'AOR'      TO WS-HIST-ACTIVITY-TYPE.
           MOVE RSP06-PAX-SEQ-NUM OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO
                WS-HIST-PAX-SEQ-NUM.
           MOVE RSP06-PAX-CITY-CODE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO  
                WS-HIST-CITY-CODE.  
PPC470*    MOVE RSP06-PAX-FARE-CODE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO  
PPC470*         WS-HIST-FARE-CODE.  
PPC470     MOVE RSP06-PAX-OFFER-CODE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO 
PPC470          WS-HIST-OFFER-CODE. 
PPC470     MOVE RSP06-PAX-FARE-TYPE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO  
PPC470          WS-HIST-FARE-TYPE.  

           MOVE RSP06-IBR-SAIL-DATE OF RSP06-NEW TO DPP02-SAIL-DATE.

           PERFORM DPP10-COMPUTE-DATE-DIFFERENCE.   

           IF (DPP02-DAYS-DIFFERENCE > 8)   
              MOVE 2 TO WS-DSPNUM1-1
           ELSE 
              MOVE 1 TO WS-DSPNUM1-1.   

           EVALUATE RSP06-PAX-AIR-IND OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB)   
               ALSO RSP06-PAX-AIR-IND OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB)   
               ALSO (RSP06-PAX-CITY-CODE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) =  
126688                 RSP06-PAX-CITY-CODE OF RSP06-OLD (NSUB)) 
              WHEN ANY ALSO 'Q' ALSO ANY
                 STRING RSP06-PAX-CITY-CODE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) 
                        ' - ON REQ ' WS-DSPNUM1-1 ' BUSN DAYS'  
                        DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-HIST-COMMENT  
              WHEN ANY ALSO 'B' ALSO ANY
                 STRING RSP06-PAX-CITY-CODE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) 
                        ' - ON REQ ' WS-DSPNUM1-1 ' BUSN DAYS'  
                        DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-HIST-COMMENT  
              WHEN 'Q' ALSO SPACE ALSO TRUE 
                 STRING RSP06-PAX-CITY-CODE OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB) 
                        ' - ' RSP06-PAX-AIR-IND OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB) 
                        ' - CLEARED REQ'
                        DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-HIST-COMMENT  
              WHEN 'B' ALSO SPACE ALSO TRUE 
                 STRING RSP06-PAX-CITY-CODE OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB) 
                        ' - ' RSP06-PAX-AIR-IND OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB) 
                        ' - CLEARED REQ'
                        DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-HIST-COMMENT  
              WHEN OTHER
                 STRING RSP06-PAX-CITY-CODE OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB) ' - '   
                        RSP06-PAX-AIR-IND OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB) '  TO  '  
                        RSP06-PAX-CITY-CODE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) ' - '   
                        RSP06-PAX-AIR-IND OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB)   
                        DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-HIST-COMMENT  
           END-EVALUATE.

           MOVE WS-HIST-COMMENT TO WS-HIST-TRF-COMMENT2.
           MOVE 'Y'             TO WS-HIST-TRF-IND. 

           PERFORM 8000-WRITE-HISTORY THRU 8099-EXIT.   

