146816         GO TO 3360-NEXT-NEW-PPR  
146816     END-IF.  

           MOVE ZERO TO OPPR-SUB.   

           PERFORM VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1  
                   UNTIL SUB > RSP06-PPR-CNT OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB)
              IF (RSP06-PPR-PKG-NUM OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB SUB) =   
                    RSP06-PPR-PKG-NUM OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB PPR-SUB)) AND  
                    (RSP06-PPR-PKG-CODE OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB SUB) =   
                    RSP06-PPR-PKG-CODE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB PPR-SUB)) AND 
                    (RSP06-PPR-PKG-TYPE OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB SUB) =   
                    RSP06-PPR-PKG-TYPE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB PPR-SUB)) 
                 MOVE SUB TO OPPR-SUB   
                 MOVE RSP06-PPR-CNT OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB) TO SUB  
              END-IF
           END-PERFORM. 

146816*    IF PPR-SUB > ZERO
146816     IF OPPR-SUB > ZERO   
              GO TO 3360-NEXT-NEW-PPR.  

