165711           MOVE ZEROES TO 
165711                       WS-OLD-CRUISE-NCF-AMT  (WS-OVERRIDE-COUNT) 
165711                       WS-NEW-CRUISE-NCF-AMT  (WS-OVERRIDE-COUNT) 
165711                       WS-OLD-MAR-AMT          (WS-OVERRIDE-COUNT)
165711                       WS-NEW-MAR-AMT          (WS-OVERRIDE-COUNT)
165711                       WS-OLD-ADDON-AMT        (WS-OVERRIDE-COUNT)
165711                       WS-NEW-ADDON-AMT        (WS-OVERRIDE-COUNT)
165711        ELSE  
165711           PERFORM 6080-DIR-DILUTION1-AMOUNT THRU 6080-EXIT   
