165711        PERFORM 8100-WRITE-TRF THRU 8199-EXIT 
165711     END-IF.  

165711     GO TO 9000-END-OF-JOB.   

165711 6075-NO-DILUTION-AMOUNT. 

165711     MOVE ZEROES   TO WS-OLD-CRUISE-NCF-AMT (WS-OVERRIDE-COUNT)   
165711                      WS-NEW-CRUISE-NCF-AMT (WS-OVERRIDE-COUNT)   
