                GBHR1-IBR-BOOK-NUM (GBHR1-ENTRY-CNT).   
PPC470     MOVE WS-HIST-FARE-TYPE TO
PPC470          GBHR1-FARE-TYPE (GBHR1-ENTRY-CNT).  
