           MOVE WS-HIST-RATE-VER-NUM TO 
                GBHR1-RATE-CODE-VERSION (GBHR1-ENTRY-CNT).  
           MOVE WS-HIST-CITY-CODE TO
                GBHR1-CITY-CODE (GBHR1-ENTRY-CNT).  
           MOVE WS-HIST-OLD-AMT TO  
                GBHR1-OLD-AMT (GBHR1-ENTRY-CNT).
           MOVE RSP06-IBR-AGENCY-CONN-CODE OF RSP06-NEW TO  
