165711     MOVE WS-NEW-BKG-FLAG          TO GTRF1-NEW-BOOK-FLAG.
165711     MOVE WS-OVERRIDE-COUNT        TO GTRF1-OVERRIDE-CNT. 

165711     PERFORM VARYING WS-OVERRIDE-SUB FROM 1 BY 1  
165711                  UNTIL WS-OVERRIDE-SUB > WS-OVERRIDE-COUNT   

165711          MOVE WS-OVERRIDE-CODE            (WS-OVERRIDE-SUB)  
165711               TO GTRF1-OVERRIDE-CODE      (WS-OVERRIDE-SUB)  
165711          MOVE WS-OLD-CRUISE-NCF-AMT       (WS-OVERRIDE-SUB)  
165711               TO GTRF1-OLD-CRUISE-NCF-AMT (WS-OVERRIDE-SUB)  
165711          MOVE WS-NEW-CRUISE-NCF-AMT       (WS-OVERRIDE-SUB)  
165711               TO GTRF1-NEW-CRUISE-NCF-AMT (WS-OVERRIDE-SUB)  
165711          MOVE WS-OLD-MAR-AMT              (WS-OVERRIDE-SUB)  
165711               TO GTRF1-OLD-MAR-AMT        (WS-OVERRIDE-SUB)  
165711          MOVE WS-NEW-MAR-AMT              (WS-OVERRIDE-SUB)  
165711               TO GTRF1-NEW-MAR-AMT        (WS-OVERRIDE-SUB)  
165711          MOVE WS-OLD-ADDON-AMT            (WS-OVERRIDE-SUB)  
165711               TO GTRF1-OLD-ADDON-AMT      (WS-OVERRIDE-SUB)  
165711          MOVE WS-NEW-ADDON-AMT            (WS-OVERRIDE-SUB)  
165711               TO GTRF1-NEW-ADDON-AMT      (WS-OVERRIDE-SUB)  
165711  
165711     END-PERFORM. 

176338     IF  WS-HIST-TRF-ACTIVITY-TYPE = 'OBA'
176338         IF  WS-HIST-USER-ID = 'SYS' OR   
181859             ( NSUB > 0 AND   
181859                NSUB < 6 AND  
181859             RSP06-POBC-USERID OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB WS-OBC-SUB) 
176338             = 'SYS') 
176338             MOVE 'SYS'         TO GTRF1-USERID   
176338         END-IF   
176338     END-IF.  

           MOVE WS-HIST-PKG-TYPE         TO GTRF1-PKG-TYPE. 
           MOVE WS-HIST-PKG-CODE         TO GTRF1-PKG-CODE. 
           MOVE RSP06-IBR-GROUP-BOOK-NUM OF RSP06-NEW TO
                GTRF1-BOOK-NUM. 
           MOVE RSP06-IBR-POLICY-TYPE OF RSP06-NEW TO   
                GTRF1-GROUP-TYPE.   
           MOVE RSP06-IBR-BOOK-NUM OF RSP06-NEW TO  
                GTRF1-IBR-BOOK-NUM. 
140524*    MOVE RSP06-IBR-AGENCY-CONN-CODE OF RSP06-NEW TO  
140524     MOVE RSP29-I-CONNECTION-CODE  TO 
                GTRF1-AGENCY-CONNECT-CODE.  
           MOVE RSP06-IBR-SYSTEM-ID OF RSP06-NEW TO 
                GTRF1-AGENCY-SYSTEM-ID. 
           MOVE RSP06-IBR-AGENCY-CONN-ID OF RSP06-NEW TO
                GTRF1-AGENCY-CONNECT-ID.

           IF (WS-HIST-CABIN-NUM > SPACE)   
              MOVE WS-HIST-CABIN-NUM         TO GTRF1-CABIN-NUM 
           ELSE 
              MOVE RSP06-IBR-CABIN-NUM OF RSP06-NEW TO GTRF1-CABIN-NUM. 

           IF (WS-HIST-CONTACT > SPACE) 
              MOVE WS-HIST-CONTACT       TO GTRF1-AGENCY-CONTACT
           ELSE 
              MOVE RSP06-IBR-AGENT-CONTACT OF RSP06-NEW TO  
                   GTRF1-AGENCY-CONTACT.

           IF WS-HIST-TRF-SAIL-DATE > ZERO  
              MOVE WS-HIST-TRF-SAIL-DATE TO GTRF1-SAIL-DATE 
           ELSE 
              MOVE RSP06-IBR-SAIL-DATE OF RSP06-NEW TO GTRF1-SAIL-DATE. 

           IF WS-HIST-TRF-SHIP-CODE > SPACES
              MOVE WS-HIST-TRF-SHIP-CODE TO GTRF1-SHIP-CODE 
           ELSE 
              MOVE RSP06-IBR-SHIP-CODE OF RSP06-NEW TO GTRF1-SHIP-CODE. 

           IF WS-HIST-TRF-DURATION-DAYS > ZERO  
              MOVE WS-HIST-TRF-DURATION-DAYS TO GTRF1-DURATION-DAYS 
           ELSE 
              MOVE RSP06-IBR-DURATION-DAYS OF RSP06-NEW TO  
                   GTRF1-DURATION-DAYS. 

           IF WS-HIST-TRF-AMT NOT = ZEROES AND  
119064          (WS-HIST-TRF-ACTIVITY-TYPE NOT = 'NBK' AND 'CDA'
119064                                                 AND 'PNA'
119064                                                 AND 'UAA')   
              MOVE 1 TO GTRF1-GROSS-CHG-IND 
              MOVE WS-STEPPED-GROSS-AMT TO GTRF1-OLD-AMT
              ADD  GTRF1-AMT            TO WS-STEPPED-GROSS-AMT 
119064     ELSE 
119064       MOVE 0 TO GTRF1-GROSS-CHG-IND. 

           STORE GTRF1-REC  
                 ON ERROR GO TO 10600-STORE-GTRF1-ERROR.

