      *=================================================================

       8200-CREATE-ASTRF-REC.   
           IF RSP06-IBR-SAIL-DATE OF RSP06-NEW < DPP02-SYSTEM-DATE  
              MOVE RSP06-IBR-SAIL-DATE OF RSP06-NEW TO  
                   DPP02-YYYYMMDD-DATE  
              MOVE RSP06-IBR-DURATION-DAYS OF RSP06-NEW TO  
                        DPP02-NUMBER-DAYS   
              PERFORM DPP10-ADVANCE-YYYYMMDD-DATE   
              IF DPP02-YYYYMMDD-DATE < DPP02-SYSTEM-DATE
                 GO TO 8299-EXIT.   

121421     PERFORM 8800-ESTABLISH-ASTR-RECS THRU 8899-EXIT. 

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       8210-CHECK-ACTIVITIES.   
           IF (WS-SEND-ASTRF-IND NOT = 'Y') 
              GO TO 8299-EXIT.  

           IF WS-HIST-TYPE = 'A'
              GO TO 8299-EXIT.  

           MOVE ZERO TO ASTRF-SUB.  

           PERFORM VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1  
                   UNTIL SUB > ASHAR-ACTIVITY-CNT   
              IF ASHAR-ACTIVITY-CODE (SUB) = WS-HIST-ACTIVITY-TYPE  
                 MOVE SUB                TO ASTRF-SUB   
                 MOVE ASHAR-ACTIVITY-CNT TO SUB 
              END-IF
           END-PERFORM. 

           IF ASTRF-SUB > ZERO  
              IF ASHAR-INCL-FLAG (ASTRF-SUB) = 'E'  
                 GO TO 8299-EXIT.   

144449 COPY SSP70INT.   

           IF ASTRF-SUB > ZERO  
              GO TO 8220-SPECIAL-ASTRF. 

           GO TO 8230-CALL-SUBROUTINE.  

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       8220-SPECIAL-ASTRF.  
           IF ASHAR-PAX-CABIN-BKG-FLAG (ASTRF-SUB) = 'P'
147885        MOVE WS-HIST-PAX-SEQ-NUM TO SSP70-PAX-SEQ-NUM.

           IF ASHAR-LEVEL-IND (ASTRF-SUB) = 'Y' 
147885        MOVE WS-HIST-ACTIVITY-TYPE TO SSP70-ACTIVITY-CODE.

       8230-CALL-SUBROUTINE.
122922     IF RSP06-IBR-BOOK-TYPE OF RSP06-NEW = 'G' AND
122922          ASTRF-SUB > ZERO AND
122922          ASHAR-PAX-CABIN-BKG-FLAG (ASTRF-SUB) = 'B'  
              MOVE RSP06-IBR-GROUP-BOOK-NUM OF RSP06-NEW TO 
147885             SSP70-BOOK-NUM   
           ELSE 
              MOVE RSP06-IBR-BOOK-NUM OF RSP06-NEW TO   
147885             SSP70-BOOK-NUM.  

147885     MOVE RSP06-IBR-BOOK-TYPE OF RSP06-NEW TO SSP70-BOOK-TYPE.
147885     MOVE RSP06-IBR-BOOK-NUM OF RSP06-NEW  TO 
147885          SSP70-CABIN-BOOK-NUM.   
147885     MOVE WS-HIST-COMMENT                  TO SSP70-COMMENTS. 
147885     MOVE 'B'                              TO SSP70-REC-TYPE. 

147885     CALL 'UCSFDASC$' USING DMCA SSP70-I-SCHEMA-NAME 12.  

147885     CALL 'SSC70TSR' USING DPP42-COMMON-DATA-FIELDS   
147885                           DPP01-COMMON-INFO  
147885                           SSP70-TRAVEL-SERVICE-TRF.  

144449*    IF DPP42-SUB-MSG-CTR > ZERO AND DPP42-SUB-MSG-STATUS (1) > 1 
144449*       GO TO 9500-RETURN-SUBROUTINE-ERROR.   

144449     IF DPP42-SUB-MSG-CTR > ZERO  
144449        IF DPP42-SUB-MSG-STATUS (1) > 1   
144449           GO TO 9500-RETURN-SUBROUTINE-ERROR 
144449        ELSE  
144449           PERFORM 9600-SAVE-SUBROUTINE-ERRORS.   

       8299-EXIT.   
           EXIT.

      *=================================================================
      *=================================================================

       8300-CREATE-ACHR-REC.
           IF RSP06-IBR-AGENCY-CONN-CODE OF RSP06-NEW = 'AM'
              NEXT SENTENCE 
           ELSE 
              GO TO 8399-EXIT.  

           IF WS-ACHR-ACTION = 'CXF' OR 'C-C'   
              NEXT SENTENCE 
           ELSE 
              IF WS-HIST-ACTIVITY-TYPE = 'CXF' OR 'CXO' OR 'CDT'
                 MOVE 'CXF' TO WS-ACHR-ACTION   
              ELSE  
                 IF WS-HIST-ACTIVITY-TYPE = 'APX' OR 'CXP' OR 'INS' 
                    MOVE 'C-C' TO WS-ACHR-ACTION
                 ELSE   
                    MOVE 'REP' TO WS-ACHR-ACTION.   

           IF (WS-ACHR-CONN-FLAG NOT = 'Y') 
              IF WS-HIST-ACTIVITY-TYPE = 'CGN' OR 'CTS' OR 'CTW'
                 MOVE 'N' TO WS-ACHR-CONN-FLAG  
                 GO TO 8399-EXIT
              ELSE  
                 MOVE 'Y' TO WS-ACHR-CONN-FLAG. 

           IF IBR-AGENCY-CONN-CODE = 'AM'   
              GO TO 8310-FETCH-ACHR-REC.

           IF RSP06-IBR-AGENCY-CONN-ID OF RSP06-NEW > SPACES OR 
                 (WS-ACHR-ACTION = 'CON')   
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE 
              MOVE SPACES TO WS-ACHR-ACTION 
              GO TO 8399-EXIT.  

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       8310-FETCH-ACHR-REC. 
           MOVE RSP06-IBR-BOOK-NUM OF RSP06-NEW TO ACHR-BOOK-NUM.   

           FETCH AGENCY-CONN-HDR-REC RECORD 
               ON ERROR GO TO 8320-CHECK-ACHR-ERROR.

           GO TO 8340-CHECK-SEND-CNT.   

       8320-CHECK-ACHR-ERROR.   
           IF ERROR-NUM = '0013'
               GO TO 8360-STORE-ACHR.   

           GO TO 11000-ACHR-ERROR.  

       8330-FETCH-DUPLICATE-ACHR.   
           FETCH NEXT DUPLICATE AGENCY-CONN-HDR-REC RECORD  
                 ON ERROR GO TO 8360-STORE-ACHR.

       8340-CHECK-SEND-CNT. 
           IF RSP06-IBR-AGENCY-CONN-CODE OF RSP06-NEW = 'AM'
              IF ACHR-SEND-CNT > ZERO   
                 GO TO 8330-FETCH-DUPLICATE-ACHR
              ELSE  
                 MOVE SPACES TO WS-ACHR-ACTION  
                 GO TO 8399-EXIT.   

           IF ACHR-ACTIVITY-CODE = 'CXF'
              IF (WS-ACHR-ACTION = 'CXF' OR 'REP')  
                 MOVE SPACES TO WS-ACHR-ACTION  
                 GO TO 8399-EXIT.   

           IF ACHR-ACTIVITY-CODE = 'REP'
              IF (WS-ACHR-ACTION = 'CON' OR 'REP')  
                 MOVE SPACES TO WS-ACHR-ACTION  
                 GO TO 8399-EXIT.   

           IF (ACHR-ACTIVITY-CODE = 'C-C' OR 'CON') 
              MOVE SPACES TO WS-ACHR-ACTION 
              GO TO 8399-EXIT.  

           IF ACHR-ACTIVITY-CODE = 'CXF'
              MOVE 'C-C' TO WS-ACHR-ACTION  
              GO TO 8350-MODIFY-ACHR.   

           IF ACHR-SEND-CNT > ZERO  
              GO TO 8330-FETCH-DUPLICATE-ACHR.  

           IF WS-ACHR-ACTION = 'CXF'
              MOVE 'CXF' TO ACHR-ACTIVITY-CODE  
           ELSE 
              IF WS-ACHR-ACTION = 'C-C' 
                 MOVE 'C-C' TO ACHR-ACTIVITY-CODE   
              ELSE  
                 MOVE SPACES TO WS-ACHR-ACTION  
                 GO TO 8399-EXIT.   

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       8350-MODIFY-ACHR.
           MOVE RSP06-IBR-AGENCY-CONN-CODE OF RSP06-NEW TO  
                ACHR-AGENCY-CONN-CODE.  
           MOVE WS-ACHR-ACTION    TO ACHR-ACTIVITY-CODE.
           MOVE DPP02-SYSTEM-DATE TO ACHR-ACTIVITY-DATE.
           MOVE DPP02-SYS-HHMMSS  TO ACHR-ACTIVITY-TIME.

           MOVE 'RSO29GCH'               TO ACHR-REQUEST-ID.

           IF WS-HIST-OLD-PHONE-NUM > ZEROS 
              MOVE WS-HIST-OLD-PHONE-NUM TO ACHR-OLD-PHONE-NUM. 

           MODIFY AGENCY-CONN-HDR-REC RECORD
                  ON ERROR GO TO 11100-MODIFY-ACHR-ERROR.   

           MOVE 'MOD'  TO WS-ACHR-ACTION.   

           GO TO 8399-EXIT. 

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       8360-STORE-ACHR. 
           IF RSP06-IBR-AGENCY-CONN-CODE OF RSP06-NEW NOT = 'AM'
              IF (WS-ACHR-ACTION = 'REP' OR 'CON') AND  
                    IBR-CANCEL-DATE > ZERO  
                 MOVE SPACES TO WS-ACHR-ACTION  
                 GO TO 8399-EXIT.   

           MOVE SPACES                           TO AGENCY-CONN-HDR-REC.
           MOVE ZERO                             TO ACHR-SEND-DATE  
                                                    ACHR-SEND-TIME  
                                                    ACHR-SEND-CNT   
                                                    ACHR-REJECT-DATE
                                                    ACHR-REJECT-TIME.   
           MOVE DPP02-SYSTEM-DATE                TO ACHR-ACTIVITY-DATE. 
           MOVE DPP02-SYS-HHMMSS                 TO ACHR-ACTIVITY-TIME. 
           MOVE RSP06-IBR-BOOK-NUM OF RSP06-NEW  TO ACHR-BOOK-NUM.  
           MOVE RSP06-IBR-BOOK-TYPE OF RSP06-NEW TO ACHR-BOOK-TYPE. 
           MOVE WS-ACHR-ACTION                   TO ACHR-ACTIVITY-CODE. 
           MOVE RSP06-IBR-AGENCY-CONN-CODE OF RSP06-NEW TO  
                ACHR-AGENCY-CONN-CODE.  

           MOVE 'RSP29GCH'               TO ACHR-REQUEST-ID.
           MOVE WS-HIST-OLD-PHONE-NUM    TO ACHR-OLD-PHONE-NUM. 

           STORE AGENCY-CONN-HDR-REC
                 ON ERROR GO TO 11200-STORE-ACHR-ERROR. 

           MOVE 'NEW'  TO WS-ACHR-ACTION.   


       8399-EXIT.   
           EXIT.

      *=================================================================

       8400-WRITE-MTRF. 
           MOVE WS-HIST-SYSTEM-DATE   TO MKP15-HIST-DATE.   
           MOVE DPP02-SYS-HHMMSS      TO MKP15-HIST-TIME.   
           MOVE 'CAG'                 TO MKP15-HIST-ACTIVITY-CODE.  

           IF (WS-HIST-CONTACT > SPACE) 
              MOVE WS-HIST-CONTACT    TO MKP15-HIST-CONTACT 
           ELSE 
              MOVE RSP06-IBR-AGENT-CONTACT OF RSP06-NEW TO  
                   MKP15-HIST-CONTACT.  

126663     MOVE WS-3CHAR-USERID     TO MKP15-HIST-OPER-INITIAL  
           MOVE WS-OLD-1-3          TO WS-AGNT-PH-1 
           MOVE WS-OLD-4-6          TO WS-AGNT-PH-2 
           MOVE WS-OLD-7-10         TO WS-AGNT-PH-3 
           MOVE WS-AGNT-COMMENT     TO MKP15-HIST-COMMENT   

           PERFORM MKP15-CREATE-MTRF-RECORD THRU MKP15-MTRF-EXIT.   

       8449-EXIT.   
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

121956 8450-WRITE-AGENT-MTRF.   
121956     MOVE RSP29-AGENT-DBKEY (HST-SUB) TO GENERIC-DBK  

121956     FETCH AGENT-REC RECORD GENERIC-DBK   
121956           ON ERROR GO TO 11400-FETCH-AGENT-ERROR.

121956     MOVE RSP29-AGENT-HIST-DESC (HST-SUB) TO MKP15-HIST-DESC. 
121956     MOVE RSP29-AGENT-ACT-CODE (HST-SUB) TO   
121956          MKP15-HIST-ACTIVITY-CODE.   
121956     MOVE RSP29-AGENT-HIST-COMMENT (HST-SUB) TO   
121956          MKP15-HIST-COMMENT. 
121956     MOVE 'M'                     TO MKP15-HIST-TYPE. 
121956     MOVE DPP01-3CHAR-USERID      TO MKP15-HIST-OPER-INITIAL. 
121956     MOVE RSP29-I-UPDATE-CONTACT  TO MKP15-HIST-CONTACT.  

121956     PERFORM MKP15-CREATE-AGENT-HISTORY THRU MKP15-MTRF-EXIT. 

121956 8499-WRITE-AGENT-MTRF-EXIT.  
121956     EXIT.

      *=================================================================

       8500-LOAD-NEW-CMT-CODES. 
            MOVE ZERO TO CSUB.  

       8510-NEXT-COMMENT-CODE.  
           ADD 1 TO CSUB.   

           IF CSUB > 5  
              GO TO 8549-EXIT.  

           IF RSP06-PAX-COMMENT-TABLE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) (CSUB:1) NOT  
                 > SPACES   
              GO TO 8510-NEXT-COMMENT-CODE. 

           MOVE ZERO TO VSUB.   

           PERFORM VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1  
                   UNTIL SUB > VCR-MISC-COMMENT-ENTRY-CTR   
              IF RSP06-PAX-COMMENT-TABLE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) (CSUB:1) = 
                    VCR-MISC-COMMENT-CODE (SUB) 
                 MOVE SUB                        TO VSUB
                 MOVE VCR-MISC-COMMENT-ENTRY-CTR TO SUB 
              END-IF
           END-PERFORM. 

           IF VSUB = ZERO   
              MOVE 19 TO DPP42-HOLD-MSG-INDEX   
              GO TO 9200-EDIT-ERROR-MSG.

           IF VCR-MISC-COMMENT-TYPE (VSUB) NOT = 'M'
              GO TO 8510-NEXT-COMMENT-CODE. 

           MOVE SPACES                       TO WS-HISTORY-AN-PARAMS.   
           MOVE LOW-VALUES                 TO WS-HISTORY-N-PARAMS.  
           MOVE 'CME'                      TO WS-HIST-ACTIVITY-TYPE 
                                              WS-HIST-TRF-ACTIVITY-TYPE.
           MOVE NSUB                       TO WS-HIST-PAX-NUM.  
           MOVE VCR-MISC-COMMENT-CODE (VSUB) TO WS-MED-CODE.
           MOVE ' ADDED.'                  TO WS-MED-ACTION.
           MOVE WS-MED-COMM-HIST-CMT       TO WS-HIST-COMMENT.  
           MOVE RSP06-PAX-SEQ-NUM OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO
                WS-HIST-PAX-SEQ-NUM.
           MOVE RSP06-PAX-CITY-CODE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO  
                WS-HIST-CITY-CODE.  
PPC470*    MOVE RSP06-PAX-FARE-CODE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO  
PPC470*         WS-HIST-FARE-CODE.  
PPC470     MOVE RSP06-PAX-OFFER-CODE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO 
PPC470          WS-HIST-OFFER-CODE. 
PPC470     MOVE RSP06-PAX-FARE-TYPE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO  
PPC470          WS-HIST-FARE-TYPE.  
           MOVE WS-HIST-COMMENT TO WS-HIST-TRF-COMMENT1 
                                   WS-HIST-TRF-COMMENT2.
           MOVE 'Y'             TO WS-HIST-TRF-IND. 

           PERFORM 8000-WRITE-HISTORY THRU 8099-EXIT.   

           GO TO 8510-NEXT-COMMENT-CODE.

       8549-EXIT.   
           EXIT.

      *=================================================================

       8550-COMPARE-MEDICAL-CODES.  
           MOVE ZERO TO OCSUB.  

       8560-NEXT-OLD-CMT-CODE.  
           ADD 1 TO OCSUB.  

           IF OCSUB > 5 
              GO TO 8570-CHECK-NEW-MEDICAL. 

           IF RSP06-PAX-COMMENT-TABLE OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB) (OCSUB:1) NOT 
                 > SPACES   
              GO TO 8560-NEXT-OLD-CMT-CODE. 

           MOVE ZERO TO CSUB.   

           PERFORM VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL SUB > 5
              IF RSP06-PAX-COMMENT-TABLE OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB) (OCSUB:1) =
                    RSP06-PAX-COMMENT-TABLE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) (SUB:1) 
                 MOVE SUB TO CSUB   
                 MOVE 5   TO SUB
              END-IF
           END-PERFORM. 

           IF CSUB > ZERO   
              GO TO 8560-NEXT-OLD-CMT-CODE. 

           MOVE ZERO TO VSUB.   

           PERFORM VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1  
                   UNTIL SUB > VCR-MISC-COMMENT-ENTRY-CTR   
              IF RSP06-PAX-COMMENT-TABLE OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB) (OCSUB:1) =
                    VCR-MISC-COMMENT-CODE (SUB) 
                 MOVE SUB                        TO VSUB
                 MOVE VCR-MISC-COMMENT-ENTRY-CTR TO SUB 
              END-IF
           END-PERFORM. 

           IF VSUB = ZERO   
              MOVE 20 TO DPP42-HOLD-MSG-INDEX   
              GO TO 9200-EDIT-ERROR-MSG.

           IF VCR-MISC-COMMENT-TYPE (VSUB) NOT = 'M'
              GO TO 8560-NEXT-OLD-CMT-CODE. 

           MOVE SPACES                     TO WS-HISTORY-AN-PARAMS. 
           MOVE LOW-VALUES                 TO WS-HISTORY-N-PARAMS.  
           MOVE 'CME'                      TO WS-HIST-ACTIVITY-TYPE 
                                              WS-HIST-TRF-ACTIVITY-TYPE.
           MOVE NSUB                       TO WS-HIST-PAX-NUM.  
           MOVE VCR-MISC-COMMENT-CODE (VSUB) TO WS-MED-CODE.
           MOVE ' REMOVED'                   TO WS-MED-ACTION.  
           MOVE WS-MED-COMM-HIST-CMT         TO WS-HIST-COMMENT.
           MOVE RSP06-PAX-SEQ-NUM OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO
                WS-HIST-PAX-SEQ-NUM.
           MOVE RSP06-PAX-CITY-CODE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO  
                WS-HIST-CITY-CODE.  
PPC470*    MOVE RSP06-PAX-FARE-CODE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO  
PPC470*         WS-HIST-FARE-CODE.  
PPC470     MOVE RSP06-PAX-OFFER-CODE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO 
PPC470          WS-HIST-OFFER-CODE. 
PPC470     MOVE RSP06-PAX-FARE-TYPE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO  
PPC470          WS-HIST-FARE-TYPE.  
           MOVE WS-HIST-COMMENT TO WS-HIST-TRF-COMMENT1 
                                   WS-HIST-TRF-COMMENT2.
           MOVE 'Y'             TO WS-HIST-TRF-IND. 

           PERFORM 8000-WRITE-HISTORY THRU 8099-EXIT.   

           GO TO 8560-NEXT-OLD-CMT-CODE.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       8570-CHECK-NEW-MEDICAL.  
           MOVE ZERO TO CSUB.   

       8580-NEXT-NEW-CMT-CODE.  
           ADD 1 TO CSUB.   

           IF CSUB > 5  
              GO TO 8599-EXIT.  

           IF RSP06-PAX-COMMENT-TABLE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) (CSUB:1) NOT  
                 > SPACES   
              GO TO 8580-NEXT-NEW-CMT-CODE. 

           MOVE ZERO TO OCSUB.  

           PERFORM VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL SUB > 5
              IF RSP06-PAX-COMMENT-TABLE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) (CSUB:1) = 
                    RSP06-PAX-COMMENT-TABLE OF RSP06-OLD (OSUB) (SUB:1) 
                 MOVE SUB TO OCSUB  
                 MOVE 5   TO SUB
              END-IF
           END-PERFORM. 

           IF OCSUB > ZERO  
              GO TO 8580-NEXT-NEW-CMT-CODE. 

           MOVE ZERO TO VSUB.   

           PERFORM VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1  
                   UNTIL SUB > VCR-MISC-COMMENT-ENTRY-CTR   
              IF RSP06-PAX-COMMENT-TABLE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) (CSUB:1) = 
                    VCR-MISC-COMMENT-CODE (SUB) 
                 MOVE SUB                        TO VSUB
                 MOVE VCR-MISC-COMMENT-ENTRY-CTR TO SUB 
              END-IF
           END-PERFORM. 

           IF VSUB = ZERO   
              MOVE 21 TO DPP42-HOLD-MSG-INDEX   
              GO TO 9200-EDIT-ERROR-MSG.

           IF VCR-MISC-COMMENT-TYPE (VSUB) NOT = 'M'
              GO TO 8580-NEXT-NEW-CMT-CODE. 

           MOVE SPACES                     TO WS-HISTORY-AN-PARAMS. 
           MOVE LOW-VALUES                 TO WS-HISTORY-N-PARAMS.  
           MOVE 'CME'                      TO WS-HIST-ACTIVITY-TYPE 
                                              WS-HIST-TRF-ACTIVITY-TYPE.
           MOVE NSUB                       TO WS-HIST-PAX-NUM.  
           MOVE VCR-MISC-COMMENT-CODE (VSUB) TO WS-MED-CODE.
           MOVE ' ADDED.'                    TO WS-MED-ACTION.  
           MOVE WS-MED-COMM-HIST-CMT         TO WS-HIST-COMMENT.
           MOVE RSP06-PAX-SEQ-NUM OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO
                WS-HIST-PAX-SEQ-NUM.
           MOVE RSP06-PAX-CITY-CODE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO  
                WS-HIST-CITY-CODE.  
PPC470*    MOVE RSP06-PAX-FARE-CODE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO  
PPC470*         WS-HIST-FARE-CODE.  
PPC470     MOVE RSP06-PAX-OFFER-CODE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO 
PPC470          WS-HIST-OFFER-CODE. 
PPC470     MOVE RSP06-PAX-FARE-TYPE OF RSP06-NEW (NSUB) TO  
PPC470          WS-HIST-FARE-TYPE.  
           MOVE WS-HIST-COMMENT TO WS-HIST-TRF-COMMENT1 
                                   WS-HIST-TRF-COMMENT2.
           MOVE 'Y'             TO WS-HIST-TRF-IND. 

           PERFORM 8000-WRITE-HISTORY THRU 8099-EXIT.   

           GO TO 8580-NEXT-NEW-CMT-CODE.

       8599-EXIT.   
           EXIT.

