156569*          USING GCC1-CITY-PHASE-NUM  
PPC470*          USING GCC1-AIR-TYPE GCC1-ADDON-AMT 
PPC470*          ON ERROR GO TO 12500-FETCH-GCC1-ERROR. 
PPC470* 
PPC470*8699-EXIT.   
PPC470*    EXIT.

      *=================================================================

       8700-LOAD-TVL-WITH-BKGS. 
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-MISC-SUB1 WS-MISC-SUB2.  

       8710-TWR-BKG-LOOP.   
           ADD 1 TO WS-MISC-SUB1.   

           IF WS-MISC-SUB1 > TWR-ENTRY-CTR  
              GO TO 8720-EXIT.  

           IF TWR-BOOK-NUM (WS-MISC-SUB1) = 
                 RSP06-IBR-BOOK-NUM OF RSP06-OLD
              GO TO 8710-TWR-BKG-LOOP.  

           IF TWR-BOOK-STATUS (WS-MISC-SUB1) = 'C'  
              GO TO 8710-TWR-BKG-LOOP.  

           ADD 1 TO WS-MISC-SUB2.   

           IF WS-MISC-SUB2 > 12 
              GO TO 8720-EXIT.  

           IF WS-MISC-SUB2 > 6  
              SUBTRACT 6 FROM WS-MISC-SUB2 GIVING WS-MISC-SUB3  
              MOVE TWR-BOOK-NUM (WS-MISC-SUB1) TO   
                   WS-TW2-BOOK-NUM (WS-MISC-SUB3)   
           ELSE 
              MOVE TWR-BOOK-NUM (WS-MISC-SUB1) TO   
                   WS-TW1-BOOK-NUM (WS-MISC-SUB2).  

           GO TO 8710-TWR-BKG-LOOP. 

       8720-EXIT.   
            EXIT.   

